The wave's own menu over a section heard by ear: «Replace this section…», its dialog (the section's own lines in the lyrics, one or two versions, an honest word when the syllables outgrow it or fall short), the lab asked with the cuts found in the rests by ear. A take made so: its stretch tinted on the wave, edged, «anew» at its top; the card over it says so. Eleven catalogs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
